      "proposed_content": "The symbolic high-height zero-free region is numerically instantiated, joined to source-reported finite-height verification and a classical explicit region across overlapping ranges, simplified by comparing the shifted and unshifted logarithmic scales, and then reflected by conjugation symmetry to give the stated absolute-height region.",
